rm‑up breath holds.\n\n    Complete one maximum breath‑hold attempt.\n\n    Save your result — the app instantly creates individualized CO₂ and O₂ tables tailored to your level.\n\nCO₂ and O₂ Tables Explained\n\nCO₂ Table\nBuilds tolerance to rising carbon dioxide levels.\nRest time decreases while breath‑hold duration stays constant.\n\nO₂ Table\nImproves comfort at lower oxygen levels.\nBreath‑hold duration increases while rest time stays constant.\n\nThese two core tables are widely used by freedivers and spearfishers to safely increase breath‑hold capacity and mental resilience.\n\nAdditional Training Modes:\n\n    Triangle breathing\n\n    Box (square) breathing\n\n    Apnea Walking\n\n    Adjustable training parameters\n\n    Voice cues, vibration alerts, and sound notifications\n\nPerfect for relaxation, focus training, and controlled breathing practice.\n\nApple Health Integration.\n\nApnea Tables syncs your breath‑hold sessions with the Apple Health app, allowing you to track progress and monitor your training history in one place.\n\nTrain smarter, breathe deeper, and improve your static apnea with Apnea Tables - your personal breath‑hold coach.", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "FR", "DE", "RU"], "fileSizeBytes": "166907904", "formattedPrice": "￦6,600", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 5, "trackContentRating": "4+", "sellerUrl": "https://apneaapps.top/", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 5, "bundleId": "-.Apnea-tables", "releaseNotes": "Adaptation for the new iOS version", "userRatingCount": 5}]}